# Store text with LF line endings no matter who commits from which OS.
# The repo already does (checked 14 Sep 2026: `git add --renormalize .` changed
# nothing); this makes it explicit and stops Windows printing
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
